==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5.33~20 seconds<sup>160f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**30 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is of utmost importance that save your [[Cat Cannon]] for the Assassin Bear. Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] for the Teacher Bears and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]]/[[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] for the Audience Bears.

